79131653152}, {"x": 0.10189675413241106, "w": 0.06812062581380207, "h": 0.01060408861628515, "y": 0.38670376965145004, "text": "Hi Monica,"}, {"text": "Wow! What an amazing holiday! We are by the sea. It's quite", "y": 0.4046511630940664, "x": 0.09838998835472038, "w": 0.3935599093967014, "h": 0.012681869195256459}, {"y": 0.4185108302284619, "w": 0.3953488159179688, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "windy but warm. The sky is blue all the time. I don't think", "x": 0.09838999769843945}, {"x": 0.10017889726944904, "w": 0.3935599093967014, "text": "I've seen a 'c ___d at all. We have been to an aquarium.", "h": 0.013914448724326735, "y": 0.43247092997161213}, {"x": 0.09838997874069538, "y": 0.4475631770565893, "text": "My sister loved the 2d", "w": 0.144901614718967, "h": 0.012727520483065188}, {"text": "-___s which jumped and", "h": 0.01154972302354207, "x": 0.27728085495830646, "w": 0.2021466912163628, "y": 0.4487409745633098}, {"h": 0.011440160007683312, "y": 0.46281976760319177, "x": 0.10017889913130387, "text": "caught fish in the air. We've also been on a boat trip to look at", "w": 0.3864042833116319}, {"x": 0.09824758041239606, "y": 0.4764440780774245, "text": "the 'w", "w": 0.045007523430718316, "h": 0.011951960036900862}, {"w": 0.2915921359592014, "x": 0.20035777331437682, "text": "_s that swim in the sea here. They were really", "h": 0.01138081348329678, "y": 0.47799418642913655}, {"y": 0.49190407019221793, "text": "big! I was quite worried when they came close to the boat!", "x": 0.10017889397280824, "w": 0.3649373711480034, "h": 0.011408204330864305}, {"x": 0.09838999136605006, "text": "Dad wanted to take a helicopter ride to an island about 20km", "y": 0.505667870053244, "w": 0.3935599093967014, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"w": 0.36672627766927085, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "away but it was very 4___y that morning. The pilot", "x": 0.10017889894115478, "y": 0.519723837259764}, {"x": 0.09838998561505592, "y": 0.5347202165549227, "text": "could